{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさんこんばんは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一ノ瀬美空です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "散歩途中のたい焼きの値段に驚いたとか、焼肉のタレ入れにピッタリそうなかわいいクリスマスのお皿を見つけたとか、色んなお話をしたいのですが！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんと嬉しいお知らせが！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先程発表されましたが、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "モデルプレスさんの、「2026年ヒット予測」に選んでいただきました！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんとびっくり、ありがとうございます！！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026年、個人でも、グループでも、大ヒットしたいです！いや、絶対にします！！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ドラマや舞台などの演技のお仕事だったり、番組のMCだったり、あとはバラエティー番組やラジオのお仕事にも、今年よりもっともっと挑戦してみたいです！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ということをここで言ったので、恥ずかしくないように来年、今よりもっと頑張ります！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また新たにうまれかわった私で、色んなことがうまくいく一年になりますように🐴"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はてれちゃんの個展に遊びに行ってきたよ🪿🪄"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はてれちゃんのこと大好きで、同期ながら池田瑛紗の大ファンなんだけど、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "彼女の好きなとこ、素敵なところがぎゅっと詰まった空間でした！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "同じ景色、同じ出来事がてれさの世界ではこうやって映ってるんだなぁと思うと、私ももっと色んなものに目を向けながら過ごしたいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いい時間でした( ¨̮ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobQnvabq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobGKNgyn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "未だに顔可愛すぎて、ツーショット撮ると顔強ばるのやめたい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⚪️「B.L.T.2026年1月号」で、表紙を務めさせていただいています⛄️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とっても楽しい撮影で、久しぶりにあんなにはしゃいだなぁってくらい笑いました！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私の表情をみればきっと、それが伝わります！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさん相変わらず温かくて優しかった(◜ᴗ◝ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1万字のインタビューも掲載していただいてます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来年の目標とか、あんまり話してこなかった過去の葛藤とか、私のありのままが読めちゃいます。"}, {"type": 